---
interface Props { slug:string }
const {slug}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="reader-comments" data-reader-comments data-slug={slug} aria-labelledby="reader-comments-heading">
 <h2 id="reader-comments-heading">質問・コメント <span data-comment-count></span></h2>
 <p class="comment-note">分からなかったところや、試してみた感想をどうぞ。投稿は運営の確認後に公開されます。</p>
 <p data-comments-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div data-comments-list></div>
 <button type="button" data-comments-more hidden>続きを表示</button>
 <button type="button" data-comments-retry hidden>読み込み直す</button>
 <button type="button" data-comments-open aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="reader-comment-form">コメントを書く</button>
 <form id="reader-comment-form" data-comments-form hidden novalidate>
  <p data-reply-label></p>
  <label>表示名（40文字まで）<input name="name" required maxlength="40" autocomplete="nickname" /></label>
  <label>コメント（2,000文字まで）<textarea name="body" required maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></label>
  <label class="comment-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
  <p class="comment-note">名前は自己申告です。個人情報は書かないでください。投稿の削除にはこのブラウザの保存データを使います。<a href="/privacy">プライバシー</a></p>
  <div class="comment-actions"><button type="submit">確認用に送信</button><button type="button" data-comments-cancel>キャンセル</button></div>
 </form>
 <div data-own-comments></div>
 <noscript><p>コメントを読む・投稿するにはJavaScriptを有効にしてください。</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
 import { initializeReaderComments } from "../lib/reader-comments";
 initializeReaderComments();
</script>
<style is:global>
.reader-comments{margin-block:2.5rem;padding-block:1.5rem;border-block:1px solid var(--noema-border,#ccc);min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.reader-comments h2{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0 0 .75rem}.reader-comments h2 span{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:400}
.reader-comments .comment-note{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.8;color:#525d59}.reader-comments button{appearance:none;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;max-width:100%;padding:.5rem 1rem;border:1px solid #216b67;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#175e5a;font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;margin:.25rem 0;white-space:normal}.reader-comments button:hover{background:#e3eeec;color:#143f3b}.reader-comments button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.reader-comments :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #216b67;outline-offset:3px}.reader-comments [hidden]{display:none!important}
.reader-comments form{margin-block:1rem}.reader-comments label{display:block;margin-block:1rem;font-size:.9rem}.reader-comments input,.reader-comments textarea{appearance:none;display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;max-width:100%;margin-top:.4rem;border:1px solid #78847e;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#202826;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:.7rem;min-width:0}.reader-comments textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:110px}.reader-comments .comment-honeypot{position:absolute;left:-10000px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}.reader-comments .comment-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem}.reader-comment{padding-block:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.reader-comment p{margin:.5rem 0}.reader-comment__meta{font-size:.8rem;color:#525d59}.reader-comment__excerpt{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:4;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.reader-comment__body{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.reader-comment__badge{display:inline-block;margin-left:.5rem;padding:.1rem .5rem;background:#e3eeec;border-radius:999px;color:#175e5a}.reader-comment__replies{margin-top:.75rem;padding:.75rem;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f3ef}.reader-comment__replies .reader-comment:last-child{border-bottom:0}.reader-comments details{margin-block:1rem}.reader-comments summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}.reader-comments summary::before{content:'＋'}.reader-comments details[open]>summary::before{content:'−'}
</style>
